        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Punto di Venezia a foliami. Popular name punto a cameo. Raised Venetian point. Gros Point de Venise. Inferior to the work of the 17th century but good for the  period. A long picot is a sign of decadence. The difference in the openwork of the toilé in this piece and that of 684 is very marked."@en ;
        ecrm:P138i_has_representation  <http://data.silknow.org/image/00c420cb-31b6-3c43-9e35-8a19d8ae5cd5> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note               "Punto di Venezia a foliami. Popular name punto a cameo. Raised Venetian point. Gros Point de Venise. Inferior to the work of the 17th century but good for the  period. A long picot is a sign of decadence. The difference in the openwork of the toilé in this piece and that of 684 is very marked."@en ;
